{
  "date": "2025-07-24",
  "messages": [
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "모해~",
      "en": "What are you doing~?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "자?",
      "en": "Are you asleep?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "보고싶었어~?",
      "en": "Did you miss me~?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "벌써 눈떠보니",
      "en": "Before I knew it,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "일본콘도 끝나있구..",
      "en": "the Japan concerts were already over..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아쉽섭섭",
      "en": "I'm kind of sad about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "곧 마카오만 남았넹",
      "en": "Now only Macau is left."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그것도 눈깜짝하면 지나있겠다 ㅠㅠ",
      "en": "That'll probably be over in the blink of an eye too. ㅠㅠ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "시간이 좀만 느리게 흘렀으면..",
      "en": "I wish time would slow down just a little..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그러네 이제 또",
      "en": "Come to think of it,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "투어를 떠나는군",
      "en": "I'm heading off on tour again."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "새로은 경험들이 많을것같아서 기대된당",
      "en": "I'm excited because I think there'll be lots of new experiences."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연이 쓰는 향수 이름 알려줘!! 가장 최근에 산걸로",
      "en": "Tell me the name of the perfume you use!! The most recent one you bought."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 맞다",
      "en": "Oh, right."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오늘 향수를 샀거든",
      "en": "I bought a perfume today."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근데 수제향수라 브랜드는 아니구",
      "en": "But it's a handmade perfume, so it's not from a brand."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근데 산 이유가",
      "en": "The reason I bought it was..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그냥 시향히고",
      "en": "I tried the tester,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "손목에 뿌랴봤다가",
      "en": "sprayed it on my wrist,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "음 그냥 그렇군",
      "en": "and at first I thought, 'Hmm... it's okay.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "했었는데",
      "en": "But then..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "좀이따가 갑자기",
      "en": "a little while later,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 평생 찾고있던",
      "en": "the scent I'd been looking for my whole life"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그 어린이집에서 났던 좋은향이",
      "en": "the nice smell I remembered from kindergarten,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나는거야",
      "en": "suddenly appeared."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래서 헉!!!",
      "en": "So I was like, 'Huh!!!'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이거다",
      "en": "\"This is it!\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어떻게 그향이 나지???",
      "en": "\"How does it smell exactly like that???\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "싶어ㅓ 운명이다 싶어서 샀어",
      "en": "It felt like fate, so I bought it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "향수에 써있는건",
      "en": "According to the label,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "화이트 머스크향이 첨가되있긴한데",
      "en": "it contains white musk."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 느끼는건",
      "en": "But to me,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭔가 은은한 꽃향에",
      "en": "it smells like soft floral notes"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "베이비파우더향",
      "en": "mixed with baby powder,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "인데 좀더",
      "en": "but it's"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아늑하고 포근한",
      "en": "warmer and cozier."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어린이집 수업시간에 화장실가려고 계단을 내려갈때",
      "en": "It's exactly the scent I smelled while walking downstairs to the bathroom during kindergarten class."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "혼자 맡았던 그 향인거야",
      "en": "That exact scent."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 ㄹㅇ",
      "en": "No, seriously."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "화장실 향이라는게 아니라;;",
      "en": "I don't mean the bathroom smelled like that. ;;"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "가던길에 스윽 맡은",
      "en": "I mean it was a scent I happened to catch"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "향이라곸ㄹㅋㄹㅋㅋㄹㄹㅋ",
      "en": "while walking there. ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㅋㄹㄹㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 좋아서 내가 평생 그런향수없나",
      "en": "I've loved it so much that I've spent my whole life wondering if there was a perfume like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "찾았는데",
      "en": "I've been searching,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "드디어 찾음",
      "en": "and I finally found it."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연이 진짜 파워블로거 재능 있는듯",
      "en": "HaYeon, I think you'd seriously have a talent for being a power blogger."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "잘할듯 ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "I think I'd be good at it. ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 그래서",
      "en": "Anyway,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이 향수에도 화이트 머스크고",
      "en": "this perfume has white musk,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 쓰는 샴푸도 화이트머스크라",
      "en": "and the shampoo I use is also white musk,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그냥 내가 화이트머스크를 좋아하는건가",
      "en": "so maybe I just really like white musk."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "생각했으",
      "en": "That's what I realized."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "일본콘 비하인드?",
      "en": "A behind-the-scenes story from the Japan concerts?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "image": "image-01.PNG"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "사실 포니테일 전에",
      "en": "Actually, before the ponytail,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "반묶음이였다가",
      "en": "I had my hair half-up,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "더워서 묶은거임",
      "en": "but it was so hot that I tied it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래서 피스없이 귀여운 포니테일 완성..",
      "en": "So I ended up with a cute ponytail without using hair extensions."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "한국콘 일본콘 합쳐서 무슨 머리가 젤 맘에 들었어",
      "en": "Out of both the Korea and Japan concerts, which hairstyle was your favorite?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나는 한국콘 1번째 날!",
      "en": "The first day of the Korea concert!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "헤헤헤",
      "en": "Hehehe."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "지연이랑 룸메 썰도 풀어줘",
      "en": "Tell us a roommate story about you and JiYeon."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "야식으로 피자를 시켜주셔서",
      "en": "They ordered pizza for us as a late-night snack,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "피자를 먹었는데",
      "en": "so we ate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "우리 둘다",
      "en": "The two of us"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "들어오자마자",
      "en": "came in,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "바로 열어서",
      "en": "opened the box right away,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그 누구보다 맛있게 먹방하심",
      "en": "and enjoyed it more enthusiastically than anyone."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "와 이건 레전드다",
      "en": "\"Wow, this is legendary.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이렇게 맛있다고?",
      "en": "\"It's this good?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이러면서",
      "en": "We kept saying things like that,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "다른멤버들 봤는데",
      "en": "then we looked at the other members,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "피자 그렇게 맛이없더라…",
      "en": "and they were all like, 'The pizza wasn't even that good...'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이러고 있는거야 ㅋㅎㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "That's what they were saying. ㅋㅎㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "우리둘이 뻘쭘",
      "en": "The two of us just awkwardly looked at each other."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "맛있었눈뎅…",
      "en": "But it was delicious..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하여나 입국 때 소녀소녀했잖아...// 청순해서 넘 좋앗어",
      "en": "HaYeon, you looked so soft and girly when you arrived back in Korea...// You looked so innocent—I loved it."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연이 사복이었어??",
      "en": "Were those your own clothes??"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "웅 내사복",
      "en": "Yep, they were my own clothes."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "에겐녀 도전기야",
      "en": "I'm on my 'Egenn girl' challenge."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나이제",
      "en": "Now I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "자구시퍼..",
      "en": "want to sleep..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "미아냉",
      "en": "Sorryyy."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "잘자구",
      "en": "Sleep well."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하랑해~😘",
      "en": "Haranghae~😘"
    }
  ]
